# Nothing in this directory may ever contain the ds4 API key.
#
# The deploy script pipes the Secret straight from homelab-maas into `oc apply`
# without writing it to disk, so these patterns are defence in depth against a
# future change (or a hand-run debugging command) that spills a credential here.
*.secret.yaml
secret-*.yaml
!secret.example.yaml
*rendered-config*.yaml
praxis-config.rendered.yaml
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.token
